@startuml
title Aveli — Main System Runtime

actor User
participant "Aveli Mobile" as Mobile
database "Local Workspace" as Local
participant "Aveli Backend" as Backend
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
participant "RevenueCat" as RC

== Bootstrap ==
User -> Mobile : open app
Mobile -> Backend : refresh session
Backend -> PG : validate session/user
Backend --> Mobile : rotated credentials
Mobile -> Local : open aveli_<userId>.sqlite
Mobile -> RC : logIn(userId)
Mobile -> Backend : GET /v1/access
Backend -> PG : grants + subscription
Backend --> Mobile : AccessStatusView
Mobile -> Mobile : Access Gate

== Local Work ==
User -> Mobile : manage clients / appointments / payments
Mobile -> Local : read/write professional workspace

== Purchase ==
User -> Mobile : purchase
Mobile -> RC : purchase
RC --> Mobile : provider result
Mobile -> Backend : POST /v1/billing/sync
Backend -> RC : subscriber lookup
RC --> Backend : subscription evidence
Backend -> PG : upsert subscription
Backend --> Mobile : AccessStatusView

== Logout ==
User -> Mobile : logout
Mobile -> RC : logOut
Mobile -> Backend : logout refresh session
Mobile -> Local : close DB\n(do not delete)
@enduml
